# Student Answer:
The main problem with this approach is that it can lead to a deadlock if all threads do not acquire the locks in a consistent order. Using the same command, ./vector-avoid-hold-and-wait -t -n 2 -l 10000 -d only takes 0.01, faster than other versions.

